Upstream: LocalAI
Base: v4.10.0 (7ad0cbf259f0c7bf9920fe2438fc3630ecd6c672)
Requires: 0001-chat-response-format-fail-closed.patch,
  0002-responses-structured-transport.patch,
  0003-tool-policy-transport.patch,
  0004-structured-tools-composition-transport.patch
Scope: Responses reasoning transport only
Purpose: the Responses frontend drops reasoning.effort when it merges the
  request into the model config, and its output side only opens a reasoning
  item from the Go-side tag extractor. A backend that classifies reasoning
  itself (ChatDelta.reasoning_content) therefore never reaches the client.
  Forward reasoning.effort like the Chat Completions path, prefer ChatDelta
  reasoning when building the non-stream reasoning item, and let ChatDelta
  reasoning open the streaming reasoning item.
Unmodified: backend.proto, tool grammar body, sampling, model loading,
  reasoning extraction, response envelope.
Note: reasoning itself is produced by the PhaseShift backend; this patch only
  transports the request lever and the backend's own reasoning classification.

Apply inside a LocalAI v4.10.0 source checkout from its root, after 0001..0004:
  git apply vendor/localai/patches/0001-chat-response-format-fail-closed.patch
  git apply vendor/localai/patches/0002-responses-structured-transport.patch
  git apply vendor/localai/patches/0003-tool-policy-transport.patch
  git apply vendor/localai/patches/0004-structured-tools-composition-transport.patch
  git apply vendor/localai/patches/0005-responses-reasoning-transport.patch

